COMMENT 2DC3
LABEL 2DC3 IDP_L5
COMMENT 2DC9
COMMENT 2DC9 Row contains blue; try next patrol-start location
COMMENT 2DCD
LABEL 2DCD IDP_L6
COMMENT 2DD0
COMMENT 2DD0 Found suitable patrol-start location; store to defender->Location
COMMENT 2DD6
COMMENT 2DD6 Fall through to cyclically advance launch-location pointer...
COMMENT 2DD6
