LABEL 30DF Sub_MainPlayLoop
COMMENT 30DF <CCHUNK>
COMMENT 30DF %%AUTOTITLE
COMMENT 30DF
COMMENT 30DF Infinite loop, performing all tasks for playing the game:
COMMENT 30DF ;;
COMMENT 30DF Move all the player's shots down, checking for hitting something
COMMENT 30DF Check for keypresses moving the player or firing a player shot
COMMENT 30DF Every Nth loop, move the defender base
COMMENT 30DF Move the player, checking for collisions
COMMENT 30DF Do one step of animation of player explosion (if active)
COMMENT 30DF Play a little bit of sound
COMMENT 30DF Do one step of animation of any active defender explosions
COMMENT 30DF Do one step of animation of defender's shot hitting something
COMMENT 30DF Do one step of animation of defender's shot
COMMENT 30DF Every Nth loop, move the defenders
COMMENT 30DF Delay to keep game at proper pace
COMMENT 30DF ;;
COMMENT 30DF In the above, "Nth" is used to denote that the action occurs once in a
COMMENT 30DF period which gets shorter as the player gets more points.
COMMENT 30DF
COMMENT 30E2
COMMENT 30E2 If the player's ship is exploding...
COMMENT 30E5 ....do not allow the player to move the ship
COMMENT 30E9
COMMENT 30E9 If key "P" pressed...
COMMENT 30F3 ....enter flashing PAUSE loop
COMMENT 30F7
COMMENT 30F7 Three bytes at `MPL_MovePlayerFromKeyboard` are overwritten by "JMP $4100"
COMMENT 30F7 if joysticks are enabled.
COMMENT 30F7
COMMENT 30F7 If key "right arrow" pressed...
LABEL 30F7 MPL_MovePlayerFromKeyboard
COMMENT 3103 ....update position to move right
COMMENT 3106
COMMENT 3106 If key "left arrow" pressed...
LABEL 3106 MPL_L1
COMMENT 3112 ....update position to move left
COMMENT 3115
COMMENT 3115 If key "down arrow" pressed...
LABEL 3115 MPL_L2
COMMENT 3121 ....update position to move down
COMMENT 3124
COMMENT 3124 If key "up arrow" pressed...
LABEL 3124 MPL_L3
COMMENT 3130 ....update position to move up
COMMENT 3133
LABEL 3133 MPL_L4
COMMENT 3136
COMMENT 3136 If key "space" pressed...
COMMENT 3142 ....fire player shot
COMMENT 3145 ....and leave flag alone
COMMENT 3147 ....otherwise ("space" not pressed), clear flag
LABEL 3147 MPL_L5
COMMENT 314A
LABEL 314A MPL_L6
COMMENT 315F
COMMENT 315F If a delay is required...
COMMENT 3164 ....do so, for time proportional to `Var_b_PostDrawDelay`
LABEL 3164 MPL_L7
COMMENT 316A
LABEL 316A MPL_L8
COMMENT 3170
COMMENT 3173 </CCHUNK>

