LABEL 3B6D Sub_PlaySoundSlice
COMMENT 3B6D <CCHUNK>
COMMENT 3B6D %%AUTOTITLE
COMMENT 3B6D Play a fragment of sound to take time proportional to PostDrawDelay.  The
COMMENT 3B6D initial half-period is set by ///B = PlaySoundSlice_InitHalfPeriod + 2///.
COMMENT 3B6D If B<17, this half-period is used for the whole sound-slice.  If B>=17, the
COMMENT 3B6D half-period increases by 1 per three half-cycles.
COMMENT 3B6D ;;
COMMENT 3B6D (If PlaySoundSlice_InitHalfPeriod or PostDrawDelay is zero, do nothing.)
COMMENT 3B6D ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
COMMENT 3B77
COMMENT 3B77 Compute approx (64)×(PostDrawDelay) into Y
COMMENT 3B7D
LABEL 3B7D PSS_L1
DEC 3B81
COMMENT 3B82
LABEL 3B82 PSS_L2
COMMENT 3B84
LABEL 3B84 PSS_L3
COMMENT 3B8C
DEC 3B90
COMMENT 3B93
COMMENT 3B98
DEC 3B99
COMMENT 3BA2
LABEL 3BA2 PSS_reset_exit
CONST 3BA4
LABEL 3BB3 PSS_exit
COMMENT 3BB4 </CCHUNK>

LABEL 3BB4 Sub_FallingPitchBeep
COMMENT 3BB4 <CCHUNK>
COMMENT 3BB4 %%AUTOTITLE
COMMENT 3BB4 Play a short beep with falling pitch.  Duration set by PostDrawDelay (do
COMMENT 3BB4 nothing if PostDrawDelay is zero).  Initial pitch set by A on entry (by
COMMENT 3BB4 means of half-period, so larger values of A give lower initial pitches);
COMMENT 3BB4 pitch then falls until duration used up.
COMMENT 3BB4 ;;
COMMENT 3BB4 Called with values of A:
COMMENT 3BB4 25 (SetGraphicsMode)
COMMENT 3BB4 1 up to 5 (LaunchPlayerShot, as long as SPC held down)
COMMENT 3BB4 8 (InitDefenderShotHit)
COMMENT 3BB4 2 (DrawOrErasePlayerExpln)
COMMENT 3BB4 1 (QueryShotsSpeed)
COMMENT 3BB4 128 (InitPostDrawDelay)
COMMENT 3BB4 ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
COMMENT 3BBB
COMMENT 3BBB Compute approx (128)×(PostDrawDelay - 4) into Y
DEC 3BBF
COMMENT 3BC2
COMMENT 3BC2 Compute (30)×(original A) into D
DEC 3BC5
COMMENT 3BC7
LABEL 3BC7 FPB_L1
COMMENT 3BCA
LABEL 3BCA FPB_L2
LABEL 3BD6 FPB_reset_exit
COMMENT 3BDE </CCHUNK>

